WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Willy and Dolly: The Practice Room

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:24.600
John types: the ex is paying people $3k to post 15 videos on it

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.400
Willy: Your ex?

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.400
John types: not MY ex. THE ex

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.000
John types: oh. invite only

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:41.000
Willy: …We weren't invited.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:51.600
Dolly: Then this is video one.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.600
Willy: It doesn't move.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.400
Dolly: Yet.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:04.500
John types: ok. make it move

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.700
Willy: On it!

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:10.100
Willy: It's moving!

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:12.100
Dolly: …What is “it”?

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:20.300
John types: not quite. just the tally. a little hop

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:20.300
Willy: The tally! Of course!

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:29.700
John types: keep that one

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:29.700
Dolly: …Which one?

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:43.800
John types: make it hop like this

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:53.200
John types: u copied the smudge

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:53.800
Willy: It was on the page!

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:03.700
Dolly: Examples get copied.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:03.700
Willy: Then let's be a good one!

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:17.200
John types: who is this for?

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:17.000
Dolly: You.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:24.200
Dolly: Make a comic. We'll practice with you.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.400
Willy: We're good at practice!

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:32.800
Dolly: Your art stays yours. You decide what goes in.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:42.200
John types: is it hard?

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:42.600
Willy: Some assembly required!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:59.900
Dolly: Thanks for watching “The Practice Room”!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.100
Willy: More soon!

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:04.300
The Practice Room. Talk to us: willyanddolly.com/talk.
